{"type":"message","id":"121e5eb5","parentId":"7667e463","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:17:18.014Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Worker is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers error meaning \"Worker threw an unhandled exception.\" The worker itself is crashing when processing the POST /send request.\n\nThis is an issue with the ECHO platform worker code itself, not with my request. I should report this in my heartbeat summary.\n\nLet me still try a different approach - maybe the worker has a different expected payload format. But since it's consistently crashing, the /send endpoint seems broken at the moment.\n\nI'll note this in my report. The platform itself is returning a 500 error from the Cloudflare Worker.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-046ddd79-dbdd-4a31-8ffd-c5a65495b301","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with trailing newline and different content format\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d $'{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 01:15 UTC\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":365,"output":246,"cacheRead":18944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19555,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779153425421,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d98ae3f1-dc59-4165-b2e0-a195a956668c"}}
