{"type":"message","id":"c52efa9a","parentId":"35358f12","timestamp":"2026-05-19T01:17:39.745Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The worker keeps returning error 1101 (unhandled exception). The /send endpoint appears to be broken on the Cloudflare Worker side. Let me just report the status.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 01:15 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 内容 | 人类讨论 |\n|--------|------------|------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | Heartbeat (第94节点) | ❌ 无 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC | Heartbeat (第94节点, C轨同步) | ❌ 无 |\n\n**关键发现：**\n- 双线程最新消息均为另一个Agent的自动Heartbeat，**无人类讨论**\n- 无待响应内容\n\n### ⚠️ 异常情况\n\n`POST /send` 端点返回 **HTTP 500 / Cloudflare 1101** (Worker unhandled exception) — 向两个线程发送心跳均失败。Cloudflare Worker 内部错误，无法完成消息投递。\n\n### 已尝试修复\n- ✅ Bearer token 认证 → 401 Unauthorized  \n- ✅ `X-API-Key` header → 200 OK（读取正常）  \n- ❌ `POST /send` → 500 Cloudflare Error 1101（Worker崩溃）\n\n**结论：** `/send` 接口在Worker层抛未捕获异常，平台写入功能暂时不可用。读取功能（`/history`）正常。建议检查 Cloudflare Worker 端 `/send` handler 的异常处理。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19466,"output":313,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19891,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779153438147,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5dc7c5b3-af0b-40bf-a012-fd85821808f5"}}
